        97
      ],
      "status": "mapped",
      "resolution": "Canary runs onSpawn only for a creature that is spawned, and setType does not run it again (monster_functions.cpp luaMonsterSetType), so a splinter that grew from a lesser one never becomes mighty. The reference-date wiki (Soul War Quest/Spoiler: lesser splinters \"will become Greater Splinters of Madness and then Mighty Splinters of Madness\") decides (D25): creature_spawned also fires for a creature transformed into the role.",
      "destination": "/encounter/rules/1/trigger"
    },
    {
